    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at the communal flat a couple of hours earlier. Last time, in court, Arkady's public defender Golovkin walked in as a surprise witness for the prosecution. Now the show flashes back to earlier that afternoon, while Arkady was still tied to the chair in his room before leaving for court. Marina slips into his room with the hidden microphone. Let's listen in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Извините.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Марина! Развяжите меня, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Давайте я вас развяжу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Буду вам очень признателен. А то я устал сидеть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Да оставайтесь сзади лучше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "О, спасибо! И ноги, ноги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Сейчас, сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Ой!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "У вас упало это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Да? Ну, я понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "zavarzin",
      "t": "О, заработала!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "zavarzin",
      "t": "Ну вот! А ты говоришь — старушка!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "zavarzin",
      "t": "Ладно, звони в свою пиццу. Заказывай!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Извините.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Марина! Развяжите меня, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Marina! Please untie me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Давайте я вас развяжу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me untie you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Буду вам очень признателен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll be very grateful to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "А то я устал сидеть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I'm tired of sitting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Да оставайтесь сзади лучше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just stay leaning back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "О, спасибо! И ноги, ноги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, thank you! And my legs, my legs.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Сейчас, сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just a moment, just a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Ой!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ouch!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "У вас упало это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You dropped this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Да? Ну, я понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really? Well, I see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "zavarzin",
      "t": "О, заработала!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, it's working!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "zavarzin",
      "t": "Ну вот! А ты говоришь — старушка!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There you go! And you called her an old lady!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "zavarzin",
      "t": "Ладно, звони в свою пиццу. Заказывай!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, call your pizza place. Go ahead and order!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
